  (text "POWER: USB VBUS -> BQ24075 power-path charger -> VSYS -> TPS63001 buck-boost -> +3V3 (always on).\nLoad switches gate the display rail and the BLE module rail. Battery voltage is read through a 1M/1M divider.\nDefaults with the MCU unpowered: EN1 = EN2 = 0 -> 100 mA input limit (safe on any USB port). MCU raises EN1 for 500 mA,\nor EN2 for the R31 limit after reading the CC pins.\n\nVALUES FROM MEMORY OF TI DATASHEETS - CONFIRM: R30 (ISET, 890/R = 0.5 A), R31 (ILIM, 1610/R = 1.0 A), TMR left open = default\nsafety timers, R32 = 10k in place of a pack NTC (use the pack's NTC if it has one), TPS63001 L2 and capacitors, CT capacitors.\nBattery connector polarity MUST be checked against the chosen cell. No VBUS over-voltage switch is fitted: BQ24075 input rating relied on."
    (at 20 15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid 9bb6b2fa-f449-5492-95c7-0050b82cef5a)
  )
